tem information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable (14d19694e) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.23017.1001) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.13 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter opening a project in Verbose Mode, attempting to quit to project list and reopen the project normally will still result in Verbose Mode being enabled.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a project in Verbose Mode by right-clicking on it on the project list > Open in Editor (Verbose Mode)\n2. Wait for the project to load, then click Project > Quit to Project List\n3. Open the project again, this time without choosing Verbose Mode\n4. The project will open, and verbose prints will still be present in the console.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":